buy.description:
What you pay when you buy energy, per kWh.

**Simple:** (spot price × (1 + markup) + fixed charges) × (1 + VAT). Put distribution, transport, certificates and supplier fees in *fixed charges*.
**Advanced:** a formula replaces the fields above it, same variables as the sell price, and it must include VAT. Example: `(pzu + 0.45) * 1.21`.

